<title>SPAIN: Cristaleria gp H1 net profit down 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Cristaleria gp H1 net profit down 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cristaleria six months to June 1996 consolidated group results, in billion of pesetas unless stated.</p>
<p> Net consolidated profit	  6.33  vs  7.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		     9.07  vs  9.19</p>
<p> Turnover			    75.33  vs 75.80</p>
<p> Parent turnover		   27.84  vs 28.76</p>
<p> Parent net profit		  5.35  vs  4.77</p>
<p>NOTE: Cristaleria is a unit of French glass maker Saint Gobain. The firm said the markets to which it sells its products performed very differently. Sales of flat glass for the building and car industries fell two percent, while fibreglass rose 19 percent and glass casing rose 14 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
